What is the function of Utility Software like Antivirus programs or Disk Defragmentation tools?
[difficulty:medium]
[chapter:Software Applications]
[tags:software,utility]
{
    =To perform specific, system-maintenance tasks in the background to keep the computer system running smoothly and securely
    ~To provide an interactive drawing canvas for traditional fine art
    ~To translate written code from English into regional scripts
    ~To connect to external websites and perform shopping transactions
}

